title: Make the collator protocol revamp the default implementation (on Polkadot)
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    Make the collator protocol revamp the default validator side collator protocol implementation for
    Polkadot and all other chainspecs.

    Pass `--experimental-collator-protocol=false` to the binary to use the legacy implementation.
crates:
- name: polkadot-cli
  bump: patch
- name: polkadot-collator-protocol
  bump: patch
